        "cooked": "<p>Been getting my butt kicked by Citizen Dawn over my last few games and I am wondering if we are playing something wrong.</p>\n<p>When a card lets the villian play a card at the end of there turn,  If that card has a end of Villian turn effect, does it go off.  IE If the card I put out is a citizen does its end of villian effect happen the turn its played(even though it was played during the end phase)</p>",
